A REQUEST, NOT A LICENSE CONDITION

Please don't submit a fork of this app for public listing on the Even Realities
Even Hub store.

Building your own copy is welcome -- including adding it to your own Even Hub
developer account and installing private builds for yourself. The concern is
only public listings: apps/glasses/app.json keeps the original package_id and
name ("Ultimate Brain"), so a public listing of a fork sits alongside the
original under the same identity. Someone could install a build talking to
your server thinking it's the maintainer's, and the store fills up with
listings that look identical.

This is a request and nothing more. The License above governs, and it permits
what it permits: fork it, modify it, add features, bundle a different speech
or language model, run it privately, run it commercially, redistribute it.
None of that requires anyone's permission.

If you've built something meaningfully different and want it listed, change the
package_id and name so it stands on its own -- or open an issue and let's talk.


